<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arco raised, Amoco cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arco raised, Amoco cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston upgraded Atlantic Richfield Co to buy from hold, cutting Amoco Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Arco was up 1/8 at 136-1/4 and Amoco added 1/8 at 87-5/8.</p>
</text>
